<script data-page="app" type="application/json">{"component":"flashcards\/study","props":{"errors":{},"name":"Topwords","auth":{"user":{"id":5,"name":"\u00c1rp\u00e1d Szaniszl\u00f3","email":"developedbybarley@gmail.com","email_verified_at":null,"two_factor_confirmed_at":null,"streak":7,"quiz_completions":1,"text_analyses":13,"last_activity_date":"2026-05-10T00:00:00.000000Z","onboarding_completed_at":"2026-04-18T19:40:25.000000Z","created_at":"2026-04-18T19:40:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-05-10T14:02:00.000000Z","stripe_id":"cus_UR8u0ziMkWwJIo","pm_type":null,"pm_last_four":null,"trial_ends_at":null,"ai_access":false,"subscriptions":[]},"isAdmin":true,"subscription":{"hasActiveAccess":true,"isSubscribed":false,"isPremium":false,"hasAiAccess":false,"isOnTrial":false}},"sidebarOpen":true,"flash":{"streakTriggered":null,"success":null,"achievements":[],"calibrationPrompt":null,"showTour":false,"importedCardId":null},"deck":{"id":34,"name":"April"},"cards":[{"id":50768,"front":"<p>I&#039;m doing an _______ at a local law firm this summer to gain some practical experience. <em>(gyakornok \/ gyakornoks\u00e1g)<\/em><\/p><p>The company is looking for a motivated individual to _______ in their marketing department. <em>(gyakornokk\u00e9nt dolgozik \/ gyakornok)<\/em><\/p><p>Her _______ period provided her with invaluable insights into the workings of the healthcare system. <em>(gyakornoki \/ gyakornoks\u00e1g)<\/em><\/p><p>He decided to _______ for a prestigious research position to further his academic career. <em>(gyakornoknak jelentkezik \/ gyakornokoskodik)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">gyakornok \/ gyakornokjel\u00f6lt \/ gyakornokoskod\u00f3 \/ seg\u00e9d \/ tanonc<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): vezet\u0151 \/ f\u0151n\u00f6k \/ \u00e1lland\u00f3 munkat\u00e1rs<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 do an _______ = gyakornoks\u00e1got v\u00e9gez (pl. She is doing an _______ in a hospital.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ program = gyakornoki program (pl. The company offers a summer _______ program.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ position = gyakornoki poz\u00edci\u00f3 (pl. He secured an _______ position at a tech startup.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ placement = gyakornoki elhelyez\u00e9s (pl. The university helps students find _______ placements.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>intern<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>internal<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>intern<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>intern<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: summer intern \/ medical intern \/ internship program \/ paid intern<\/span><\/p><p>similar: trainee \/ apprentice \/ stagiaire \/ junior<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: supervisor \/ manager \/ senior employee<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"intern internal","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":5,"lapses":1,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"6 nap","good":"12 nap","easy":"15 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-12T20:41:15+00:00"},{"id":51183,"front":"<p>She was ________d to manager after just two years with the company. (el\u0151l\u00e9ptet \/ kinevez)<\/p><p>The campaign was designed to ________ healthy eating habits. (n\u00e9pszer\u0171s\u00edt \/ el\u0151seg\u00edt)<\/p><p>They hired an agency to ________ their new product on social media. (rekl\u00e1moz \/ n\u00e9pszer\u0171s\u00edt)<\/p><p>The charity works to ________ equal rights for all children. (el\u0151mozd\u00edt \/ t\u00e1mogat)<\/p><p>el\u0151l\u00e9ptet \/ n\u00e9pszer\u0171s\u00edt \/ rekl\u00e1moz \/ el\u0151mozd\u00edt \/ el\u0151seg\u00edt<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU): lefokoz \/ akad\u00e1lyoz \/ visszafog \/ elnyom<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ sb = el\u0151l\u00e9ptet valakit (munk\u00e1ban)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ sth = rekl\u00e1moz \/ n\u00e9pszer\u0171s\u00edt \/ el\u0151seg\u00edt valamit<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 f\u0151n\u00e9v: ________ion = el\u0151l\u00e9ptet\u00e9s \/ rekl\u00e1m \/ akci\u00f3<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 mell\u00e9kn\u00e9v: ________ional = prom\u00f3ci\u00f3s, rekl\u00e1m jelleg\u0171<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 get a ________ion = el\u0151l\u00e9ptet\u00e9st kap<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>noun: promotion<\/p><p>verb: promote<\/p><p>past tense \/ -ing form: promoted \/ promoting<\/p><p>adjective: promotional<\/p><p>common pair: get a promotion \/ promote a product \/ promote health \/ promote equality<\/p><p>similar: advance \/ advertise \/ encourage \/ support \/ upgrade<\/p><p>negative: demote \/ hinder \/ suppress \/ hold back<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":10,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"12 nap","good":"25 nap","easy":"33 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-16T10:05:32+00:00"},{"id":51242,"front":"<p>After years of hard work, she finally achieved her _______ and opened her own bakery. <em>(gy\u0151zelem \/ siker)<\/em><\/p><p>The ancient Romans celebrated military _______ with grand parades and elaborate ceremonies. <em>(diadal \/ gy\u0151zelmi \u00fcnnep)<\/em><\/p><p>The scientific community hailed the discovery as a major _______ in the fight against the disease. <em>(\u00e1tt\u00f6r\u00e9s \/ eredm\u00e9ny)<\/em><\/p><p>The novel&#039;s climax depicts the hero&#039;s ultimate _______ over his inner demons. <em>(gy\u0151zelem \/ diadal)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">gy\u0151zelem \/ siker \/ diadal \/ eredm\u00e9ny \/ \u00e1tt\u00f6r\u00e9s<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): veres\u00e9g \/ kudarc \/ buk\u00e1s<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a _______ of = valaminek a gy\u0151zelme\/diadala (pl. a triumph of the human spirit)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ victory = diadalmas gy\u0151zelem (pl. a hard-won triumph victory)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ over = gy\u0151zelem valami felett (pl. their triumph over adversity)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ in = siker valamiben (pl. a triumph in science)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>triumph<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>triumphant<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>triumphantly<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>triumph<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>triumph<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: hard-won triumph \/ sweet triumph \/ moral triumph \/ personal triumph<\/span><\/p><p>similar: victory \/ success \/ achievement \/ win<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: defeat \/ failure \/ loss<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"triumphant\ntriumphantly\ntriumph\ntriumph","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"4 nap","good":"7 nap","easy":"9 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-09T21:04:49+00:00"},{"id":51194,"front":"<p>She ________ed every shop in the city looking for the perfect dress. (\u00e1tkutat \/ v\u00e9gigkeres)<\/p><p>He ________ed the pan until it was completely clean and shiny. (s\u00farol \/ sik\u00e1l)<\/p><p>The police ________ed the area for any sign of the missing child. (\u00e1tkutat \/ \u00e1tvizsg\u00e1l)<\/p><p>The river had ________ed a deep channel through the rock over centuries. (kiv\u00e1jt \/ kimosott)<\/p><p>\u00e1tkutat \/ v\u00e9gigkeres \/ s\u00farol \/ sik\u00e1l \/ kiv\u00e1jt<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU): fel\u00fcletesen n\u00e9z \/ elhagy \/ figyelmen k\u00edv\u00fcl hagy<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ sth for sth = \u00e1tkutat valamit valami ut\u00e1n<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ a pan \/ surface = s\u00farol, sik\u00e1l (tiszt\u00edt\u00e1s c\u00e9lj\u00e1b\u00f3l)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ the internet \/ shops = alaposan v\u00e9gigkeres \/ \u00e1tkutat<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 f\u0151n\u00e9v: ________ing pad = s\u00farol\u00f3 \/ tiszt\u00edt\u00f3korong<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a river ________s = a foly\u00f3 kiv\u00e1jja \/ kimossa a medret<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>verb: scour<\/p><p>past tense \/ -ing form: scoured \/ scouring<\/p><p>noun: scouring pad<\/p><p>common pair: scour the area \/ scour the internet \/ scour a pan \/ scour for clues<\/p><p>similar: search \/ comb \/ scrub \/ sweep \/ hunt through<\/p><p>negative: overlook \/ ignore \/ glance \/ skim<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":null,"review":{"state":"relearning","interval":1,"lapses":1,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"1 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-08T20:54:52+00:00"},{"id":51236,"front":"<p>Can you please _______ that article for me? I need to check a fact. <em>(megeml\u00edt \/ hivatkozni)<\/em><\/p><p>The research paper must _______ at least ten peer-reviewed sources. <em>(hivatkozni \/ megjel\u00f6lni)<\/em><\/p><p>He was _______ for his bravery during the rescue mission. <em>(kit\u00fcntetni \/ elismerni)<\/em><\/p><p>The lawyer will _______ the relevant legal precedents in her closing argument. <em>(hivatkozni \/ eml\u00edteni)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">hivatkozni \/ eml\u00edteni \/ id\u00e9zni \/ megeml\u00edteni \/ kit\u00fcntetni<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): elfelejteni \/ elhagyni \/ nem eml\u00edteni<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a source = forr\u00e1sra hivatkozni (pl. You must cite your sources.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ evidence = bizony\u00edt\u00e9kot megeml\u00edteni\/hivatkozni r\u00e1 (pl. Please cite the evidence that supports your claim.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ an example = p\u00e9ld\u00e1t hozni\/eml\u00edteni (pl. Can you cite an example of this phenomenon?)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ someone for something = valakit valamivel kapcsolatban megeml\u00edteni\/elismerni (pl. She was cited for her outstanding contribution.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>cite<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>citation<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>cite<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: cite sources \/ cite evidence \/ cite an example \/ cite a case<\/span><\/p><p>similar: quote \/ reference \/ mention \/ invoke<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: ignore \/ omit \/ disregard<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"cite\ncitation","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"4 nap","good":"7 nap","easy":"9 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-11T17:49:42+00:00"},{"id":50761,"front":"<p>The meeting will _______ place in the conference room at 10 AM. <em>(megtart\u00e1sra ker\u00fcl \/ lesz)<\/em><\/p><p>The annual festival is scheduled to _______ place during the first week of August. <em>(megrendez\u00e9sre ker\u00fcl \/ zajlik)<\/em><\/p><p>The research study aims to investigate how these phenomena _______ place in complex systems. <em>(v\u00e9gbemennek \/ t\u00f6rt\u00e9nnek)<\/em><\/p><p>A dramatic rescue operation began to _______ place as the sun set over the horizon. <em>(megkezd\u0151dik \/ lefolyik)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">megt\u00f6rt\u00e9nik \/ zajlik \/ v\u00e9gbemegy \/ lefolyik \/ megrendez\u00e9sre ker\u00fcl<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): elmarad \/ nem t\u00f6rt\u00e9nik meg \/ megakad\u00e1lyozva van<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ place = megt\u00f6rt\u00e9nik, zajlik (pl. The event will take place next week.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 scheduled to _______ place = tervezett id\u0151pontban zajlik\/megrendez\u00e9sre ker\u00fcl (pl. The concert is scheduled to take place on Saturday.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ place in = valamilyen helyen\/k\u00f6rnyezetben t\u00f6rt\u00e9nik (pl. The accident took place in the city center.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ place during = valamikor t\u00f6rt\u00e9nik (pl. The negotiations will take place during the summit.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>take place<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: take place \/ will take place \/ took place \/ take place in<\/span><\/p><p>similar: occur \/ happen \/ transpire \/ be held<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: not happen \/ be cancelled \/ be prevented<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"take place","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":7,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"8 nap","good":"19 nap","easy":"24 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-08T20:58:22+00:00"},{"id":51243,"front":"<p>The most direct route to the city center is through the park. <em>(legk\u00f6zvetlenebb \/ legbiztosabb)<\/em><\/p><p>Her feedback was honest and most direct, leaving no room for misinterpretation. <em>(egyenes \/ ny\u00edlt)<\/em><\/p><p>The study aimed to establish the most direct causal link between the two variables. <em>(legk\u00f6zvetlenebb \/ legbiztosabb)<\/em><\/p><p>He chose the most direct approach to solving the problem, cutting through all the unnecessary steps. <em>(legk\u00f6zvetlenebb \/ legc\u00e9ltudatosabb)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">legk\u00f6zvetlenebb \/ legbiztosabb \/ legnyilv\u00e1nval\u00f3bb \/ legk\u00f6zvetlenebb \u00fat \/ legk\u00f6zvetlenebb m\u00f3don<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): k\u00f6zvetett \/ k\u00f6r\u00fclm\u00e9nyes \/ burkolt<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 the _______ route = a legk\u00f6zvetlenebb \u00fatvonal (pl. the most direct route)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 the _______ way = a legk\u00f6zvetlenebb m\u00f3dja (pl. the most direct way to learn)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 the _______ answer = a legk\u00f6zvetlenebb v\u00e1lasz (pl. null)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 the _______ approach = a legk\u00f6zvetlenebb megk\u00f6zel\u00edt\u00e9s (pl. null)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>direct<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>direct<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>directly<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>direct<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: most direct route \/ most direct way \/ most direct approach \/ most direct contact<\/span><\/p><p>similar: straightest \/ shortest \/ simplest \/ bluntest<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: indirect \/ circuitous \/ roundabout<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":5,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"6 nap","good":"13 nap","easy":"16 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-14T21:06:37+00:00"},{"id":51245,"front":"<p>The teacher gave us an _______ of our progress at the end of the semester. <em>(\u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9s \/ felm\u00e9r\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p>A thorough risk _______ is crucial before launching a new product. <em>(felm\u00e9r\u00e9s \/ \u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p>The _______ of the patient&#039;s condition revealed a need for immediate surgery. <em>(\u00e1llapotfelm\u00e9r\u00e9s \/ diagn\u00f3zis)<\/em><\/p><p>Her _______ of the situation was remarkably accurate, predicting the outcome with precision. <em>(\u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9se \/ felm\u00e9r\u00e9se)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">\u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9s \/ felm\u00e9r\u00e9s \/ m\u00e9rlegel\u00e9s \/ becsl\u00e9s \/ diagn\u00f3zis<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): elhanyagol\u00e1s \/ figyelmen k\u00edv\u00fcl hagy\u00e1s \/ megtagad\u00e1s<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 perform an _______ = v\u00e9gezni egy \u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9st\/felm\u00e9r\u00e9st (pl. The company will perform an _______ of its financial performance.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 conduct an _______ = lefolytatni egy \u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9st\/felm\u00e9r\u00e9st (pl. The committee will conduct an _______ of the proposals.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 formal _______ = hivatalos \u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9s\/felm\u00e9r\u00e9s (pl. The _______ is required for all employees.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 self _______ = \u00f6n\u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9s (pl. She completed a self _______ of her strengths and weaknesses.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 peer _______ = szak\u00e9rt\u0151i \u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9s (pl. The research paper underwent peer _______ before publication.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>assessment<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>assessment<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>assess<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: performance assessment \/ risk assessment \/ needs assessment \/ initial assessment<\/span><\/p><p>similar: evaluation \/ appraisal \/ judgment \/ estimation<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: neglect \/ ignorance \/ disregard<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"4 nap","good":"7 nap","easy":"9 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-11T17:28:18+00:00"},{"id":51187,"front":"<p>He ________ed in pain when the doctor touched his injured shoulder. (ny\u00f6g \/ jajgat)<\/p><p>She always ________s about the weather but never moves anywhere. (panaszkodik \/ nyafog)<\/p><p>A low ________ escaped from the patient as he tried to sit up. (ny\u00f6g\u00e9s \/ jajsz\u00f3)<\/p><p>Stop ________ing and just get on with the work! (panaszkodni \/ nyafogni)<\/p><p>ny\u00f6g \/ jajgat \/ panaszkodik \/ nyafog \/ ny\u00f6g\u00e9s<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU): hallgat \/ el\u00e9gedett \/ nem panaszkodik<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ (verb) = ny\u00f6g (f\u00e1jdalomt\u00f3l) \/ panaszkodik (inform\u00e1lis)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ (noun) = ny\u00f6g\u00e9s \/ panasz \/ jajsz\u00f3<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ about sth = panaszkodik valamir\u0151l (inform\u00e1lis, brit)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 give a ________ = ny\u00f6g egyet \/ panaszkodik<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 hasonl\u00f3: groan = m\u00e9lyebb ny\u00f6g\u00e9s \/ whine = nyiv\u00e1kol \/ complain = panaszkodik<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>noun: moan<\/p><p>verb: moan<\/p><p>past tense \/ -ing form: moaned \/ moaning<\/p><p>common pair: moan in pain \/ moan about sth \/ let out a moan \/ stop moaning<\/p><p>similar: groan \/ whine \/ complain \/ whimper \/ grumble<\/p><p>negative: cheer \/ praise \/ stay silent \/ be content<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":5,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"6 nap","good":"12 nap","easy":"15 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-16T17:28:22+00:00"},{"id":51253,"front":"<p>The children were playing with _______ toys made of wood. <em>(egyszer\u0171 \/ alapvet\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p>The company&#039;s initial business plan was quite _______, lacking many details. <em>(v\u00e1zlatos \/ nem kidolgozott)<\/em><\/p><