lations. <em>(b\u00fcntet\u00e9s \/ k\u00e1rp\u00f3tl\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>He felt a deep sense of remorse and sought spiritual _______ through fasting and prayer. <em>(megtisztul\u00e1s \/ engesztel\u0151 cselekedet)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">vezekl\u00e9s \/ engesztel\u00e9s \/ b\u0171nb\u00e1nat \/ j\u00f3v\u00e1t\u00e9tel \/ b\u00fcntet\u00e9s<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): megbocs\u00e1t\u00e1s \/ jutalom \/ engedm\u00e9ny<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 do _______ = vezekl\u00e9st v\u00e9gezni (pl. He decided to do penance for his past actions.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 act of _______ = engesztel\u0151 cselekedet (pl. Donating to charity was seen as an act of penance.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 seek _______ = vezekl\u00e9st keresni (pl. She sought penance for her betrayal.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 offer _______ = j\u00f3v\u00e1t\u00e9telt felaj\u00e1nlani (pl. He offered penance by working for free.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>penance<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>penance<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: do penance \/ act of penance \/ seek penance \/ offer penance<\/span><\/p><p>similar: atonement \/ reparation \/ expiation \/ remorse<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: reward \/ forgiveness \/ indulgence<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"penance\npenance","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"4 nap","good":"7 nap","easy":"9 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-10T10:05:46+00:00"},{"id":51200,"front":"<p>The campaign was launched ________ to raise awareness about recycling. (orsz\u00e1gszerte \/ az eg\u00e9sz orsz\u00e1gban)<\/p><p>A ________ strike brought public transport to a halt for two days. (orsz\u00e