d to overrun the enemy positions.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ budget = t\u00fall\u00e9p, meghalad (k\u00f6lts\u00e9gvet\u00e9st) (pl. The project is in danger of going over budget.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ by = valami \u00e1ltal elbor\u00edtva\/ben\u0151ve (pl. The city was overrun by tourists.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>overrun<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>overrun<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>overrun<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: overrun by \/ overrun with \/ overrun the market \/ overrun defenses<\/span><\/p><p>similar: invade \/ overwhelm \/ flood \/ inundate<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: repel \/ defend \/ contain<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"lapses":1,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"4 nap","good":"8 nap","easy":"10 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-11T10:05:10+00:00"},{"id":51231,"front":"<p>Be careful not to _______ the water supply with chemicals. <em>(szennyez \/ megfert\u0151z)<\/em><\/p><p>The investigation revealed that the food had been _______ during processing. <em>(fert\u0151z\u00f6tt\u00e9 v\u00e1lt \/ szennyezett\u00e9 v\u00e1lt)<\/em><\/p><p>Environmental regulations aim to prevent industries from _______ natural resources. <em>(k\u00e1ros\u00edt \/ szennyez)<\/em><\/p><p>The ancient artifact was _______ by centuries of burial in the damp soil. <em>(megrong\u00e1l\u00f3dott \/ szennyez\u0151d\u00f6tt)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">szennyez \/ fert\u0151z \/ megront \/ beszennyez \/ rombol<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): tiszt\u00edt \/ steriliz\u00e1l \/ megtiszt\u00edt<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the water = a vizet szennyezni (pl. Pollution can ___