everyone.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ apology = \u0151szinte bocs\u00e1natk\u00e9r\u00e9s (pl. He offered a _______ apology for his mistake.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ concern = \u0151szinte aggodalom (pl. We appreciate your _______ concern for the project&#039;s success.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ interest = val\u00f3di \u00e9rdekl\u0151d\u00e9s (pl. Show _______ interest in what they have to say.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>genuine<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>genuine<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>genuinely<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>genuineness<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: genuine leather \/ genuine concern \/ genuine emotion \/ genuine interest<\/span><\/p><p>similar: authentic \/ real \/ sincere \/ legitimate<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: fake \/ artificial \/ counterfeit<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"genuine\ngenuinely\ngenuineness","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":5,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"6 nap","good":"13 nap","easy":"16 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-08T20:57:08+00:00"},{"id":51253,"front":"<p>The children were playing with _______ toys made of wood. <em>(egyszer\u0171 \/ alapvet\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p>The company&#039;s initial business plan was quite _______, lacking many details. <em>(v\u00e1zlatos \/ nem kidolgozott)<\/em><\/p><p>The archaeological dig uncovered _______ tools, suggesting a very early stage of human development. <em>(kezdetleges \/ primit\u00edv)<\/em><\/p><p>His understanding of quantum physics was _______; he had only read the introductory chapter. <em>(fel\u00fcletes \/ alapfok\u00fa)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">alapvet\u0151 \/ kezdetleges \/ egyszer\u0171 \/ v\u00e1zlatos \/ primit\u00edv<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Ne