elt\u00e9r\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">elker\u00fcl \/ megel\u0151z \/ elh\u00e1rit \/ megakad\u00e1lyoz \/ elt\u00e9r\u00edt<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): szembesz\u00e1ll \/ k\u00f6zeledik \/ figyelmen k\u00edv\u00fcl hagy<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ disaster = disaster elker\u00fcl\u00e9se (pl. The early warning system helped to avert disaster.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a crisis = v\u00e1ls\u00e1g elker\u00fcl\u00e9se (pl. Diplomacy was used to avert a major crisis.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ one&#039;s eyes = szemet elford\u00edt (pl. He averted his eyes, unable to look at the scene.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a collision = \u00fctk\u00f6z\u00e9s elker\u00fcl\u00e9se (pl. The driver managed to avert a collision.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>avert<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>aversion<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>avert<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: avert disaster \/ avert a crisis \/ avert collision \/ avert gaze<\/span><\/p><p>similar: prevent \/ avoid \/ ward off \/ forestall<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: face \/ confront \/ invite<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"avert aversion","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"4 nap","good":"7 nap","easy":"9 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-11T21:05:46+00:00"},{"id":51239,"front":"<p>Eating enough dietary _______ is important for good digestion. <em>(rost \/ \u00e9lelmi rost)<\/em><\/p><p>The scientist examined the microscopic _______ structure of the new material. <em>(sz\u00e1l \/ rostszerkezet)<\/em><\/p><p>The rough wool felted into a dense, matted _______. <em>(sz\u00e1l \/ rost)<\/em><\/p><p>She carefully pulled a single _______ from the unraveling thread. <em>(sz\u00e1l \/ rostsz\u00e1l)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">rost \/ sz\u00e1l \/ rostsz\u00e1l \/ fon\u00e1l<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): t\u00f6m\u00f6r \/ s\u0171r\u0171 \/ szil\u00e1rd<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 dietary _______ = \u00e9trendi rost (pl. Increase your intake of dietary _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ structure = rostszerkezet (pl. The _______ structure of the plant was analyzed.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ optic = optikai sz\u00e1l (pl. The internet connection uses _______ optic cables.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 natural _______ = term\u00e9szetes rost (pl. Cotton is a popular natural _______.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>fibre<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>fibre<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: dietary fibre \/ optic fibre \/ natural fibre \/ fibre optic<\/span><\/p><p>similar: strand \/ thread \/ filament \/ fiber<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: solid \/ mass \/ bulk<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"fibre","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":5,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"6 nap","good":"13 nap","easy":"16 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-14T21:04:04+00:00"},{"id":49577,"front":"<p>The judge was accused of having a _______ against the defendant. <em>(elfogults\u00e1g \/ el\u0151\u00edt\u00e9let)<\/em><\/p><p>It&#039;s important to be aware of your own _______ when interpreting data. <em>(elfogults\u00e1g \/ szeml\u00e9letm\u00f3d)<\/em><\/p><p>The news report seemed to have a political _______. <em>(elfogults\u00e1g \/ ir\u00e1nyults\u00e1g)<\/em><\/p><p>We need to eliminate any _______ in the hiring process. <em>(elfogults\u00e1g \/ diszkrimin\u00e1ci\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">elfogults\u00e1g \/ el\u0151\u00edt\u00e9let \/ szeml\u00e9letm\u00f3d \/ ir\u00e1nyults\u00e1g \/ r\u00e9szrehajl\u00e1s<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): objektivit\u00e1s \/ p\u00e1rtatlans\u00e1g \/ semlegess\u00e9g<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 show _______ = elfogults\u00e1got mutatni (pl. The referee seemed to show _______ towards the home team.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 have a _______ against = elfogults\u00e1ga van valaki\/valami ellen (pl. She felt the teacher had a _______ against her because of her accent.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 unconscious _______ = tudattalan elfogults\u00e1g (pl. Many hiring managers struggle with unconscious _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 eliminate _______ = elfogults\u00e1got megsz\u00fcntetni (pl. The company is working to eliminate _______ in its marketing campaigns.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 political _______ = politikai elfogults\u00e1g (pl. The article was criticized for its obvious political _______.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>noun: <strong>bias<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>bias<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: show bias \/ have a bias against \/ unconscious bias \/ eliminate bias<\/span><\/p><p>similar: prejudice \/ partiality \/ favoritism \/ leaning<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: impartiality \/ objectivity \/ fairness<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":1,"lapses":1,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"2 nap","good":"3 nap","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-09T21:06:28+00:00"},{"id":51249,"front":"<p>There was a _______ hint of garlic in the sauce that made it delicious. <em>(finom \/ enyhe)<\/em><\/p><p>The politician&#039;s speech contained a _______ criticism of the opposing party&#039;s policies. <em>(burkolt \/ nem egy\u00e9rtelm\u0171)<\/em><\/p><p>The research identified a _______ correlation between the two variables, requiring further investigation. <em>(apr\u00f3 \/ nem nyilv\u00e1nval\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>She wore a dress with a _______ pattern of tiny flowers, almost imperceptible at first glance. <em>(apr\u00f3 \/ diszkr\u00e9t)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">finom \/ enyhe \/ burkolt \/ apr\u00f3 \/ diszkr\u00e9t<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): nyilv\u00e1nval\u00f3 \/ felt\u0171n\u0151 \/ er\u0151s<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ difference = finom k\u00fcl\u00f6nbs\u00e9g (pl. There&#039;s a subtle difference between these two shades of blue.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ hint = finom utal\u00e1s (pl. He gave a subtle hint that he wanted to leave.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ change = enyhe v\u00e1ltoz\u00e1s (pl. We noticed a subtle change in his behavior.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ criticism = burkolt kritika (pl. Her review contained subtle criticism of the author&#039;s style.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>subtle<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>subtle<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>subtly<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>subtlety<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: subtle difference \/ subtle hint \/ subtle change \/ subtle way<\/span><\/p><p>similar: delicate \/ fine \/ nuanced \/ understated<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: obvious \/ apparent \/ blatant<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"subtle\nsubtly","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":1,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"2 nap","good":"3 nap","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":