 border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): ellent\u00e9tben \/ szemben \/ \u00f6n\u00e1ll\u00f3an<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 on _______ of = valaki nev\u00e9ben, valaki k\u00e9pviselet\u00e9ben (pl. She spoke on behalf of the entire organization.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 in _______ of = valaki \u00e9rdek\u00e9ben, valaki jav\u00e1ra (pl. The donation was made in behalf of the local charity.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 act on _______ = valaki nev\u00e9ben elj\u00e1rni (pl. He was authorized to act on my behalf.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 speak on _______ = valaki nev\u00e9ben besz\u00e9lni (pl. Please speak on behalf of your group.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>behalf<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: on behalf of \/ in behalf of \/ act on behalf \/ speak on behalf<\/span><\/p><p>similar: representation \/ proxy \/ stead \/ name<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: individually \/ personally \/ independently<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"behalf","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":4,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"5 nap","good":"9 nap","easy":"12 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-10T17:33:20+00:00"}]},"url":"\/flashcards\/34\/study","version":"54de2404fb45542b18ecc7fb1a4b3c51","sharedProps":["errors","name","auth","sidebarOpen","flash"]}</script><div id="app"></div>